ion it on the number. Their numeric slots (val_a, val_b, answer) repeat generated values drawn from 2 to 9, so every such number is 2 or more, and a singular noun can be printed beside it, which is ungrammatical text a grade 1 learner reads. F05 draws max and min each from the members 2 to 9, with distinct true and no derived_from_values tying max to be the greater, so the domain allows a render that prints a false comparison statement with the smaller value first. F02, F04 and F06 pass: their unit slots repeat one generated plural unit value (F02 and F04 print only plural units), their comparison words are longer and shorter, and their values stay within 2 to 9 in a sentence within the word limit. F06 prints only option keys.\"}",
